{"unit_id":"STARDUSTLC666__dsh-ppt#card-zh","repo":"STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ppt","commit":"f2263f5260cf9453d1ad5d3c9a85c55ee3999c70","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ppt 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的演示文稿技能与工具插件。它注册生成、主题、模板、编辑、撤销、检查和渲染工具，并在侧栏工作台管理项目。用户可用准备好的 Markdown 或结构化页面生成独立 HTML 放映、可编辑 PPTX 与 JSON 工程，之后编辑页面、调整顺序并撤销修改。插件也提供主题预览、数据推演、AI 预审与答辩演练等流程。适合需要制作和迭代汇报、答辩或路演材料的 DSH 用户；无需额外密钥，AI 功能使用宿主提供的模型服务，PPTX 渲染可选用 LibreOffice Kit。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:42","src/tools.ts:208","src/workbench.ts:15"]}
{"unit_id":"STARDUSTLC666__dsh-ppt#card-en","repo":"STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ppt","commit":"f2263f5260cf9453d1ad5d3c9a85c55ee3999c70","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-ppt is a DSH web plugin that turns Markdown or structured slides into HTML, editable PPTX and JSON projects. Users can choose themes, edit slides, undo changes and check projects. Optional tools support data scenarios and AI review. No separate key is configured; AI uses the host model.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:42","src/tools.ts:208","src/workbench.ts:15"]}
