{"unit_id":"STARDUSTLC666__dsh-ppt#feature-create","repo":"STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ppt","commit":"f2263f5260cf9453d1ad5d3c9a85c55ee3999c70","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ppt 的功能「生成演示文稿」：把 Markdown 或结构化页面生成 HTML 放映、可编辑 PPTX 和 JSON 工程。通过 ppt_create 触发，可选主题、图片和图表。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:228"]}
{"unit_id":"STARDUSTLC666__dsh-ppt#feature-edit","repo":"STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ppt","commit":"f2263f5260cf9453d1ad5d3c9a85c55ee3999c70","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ppt 的功能「按页编辑与撤销」：在已有 JSON 工程中修改、复制、删除或重排页面，并保留撤销记录。通过 ppt_edit 修改、ppt_undo 撤销；编辑后重新生成 HTML、PPTX 和 JSON 文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:258"]}
{"unit_id":"STARDUSTLC666__dsh-ppt#feature-check","repo":"STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ppt","commit":"f2263f5260cf9453d1ad5d3c9a85c55ee3999c70","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ppt 的功能「演示文稿检查」：检查工程页面并报告具体页的问题和建议，不重写文件。通过 ppt_check 触发，可查看文字密度、溢出估算、表格字号、图片和图表标签等提示。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:292"]}
